            "backendName": "data.freeSize",
            "description_en": "<props=\"china\">The free backup quota for the instance. Unit: bytes. The free quota is equal to the default memory capacity of the instance type. For more information, see [Announcement on the commercialization of backups]（https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2664017.html）.\nFull backups and log backups share this free quota. When you change the instance type, the free quota of the instance changes accordingly.</props>\n<props=\"intl\">This parameter is invalid. Ignore this parameter.</props>",
